              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "4"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Maggie Ker"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I made this with my last bag of apples from last year's harvest (frozen) and it came out wonderfully, though the recipe calls for way too much sugar for my taste. I cut a 1/2 cup out of the recipe and probably could have taken out a little bit more. Still, it was quick and yummy.",
            "datePublished": "2018-04-18T01:40:03.267Z"
